{"id": "85941", "name": "Diagnostic_ALG-FAC_2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Give the remainder when {{CT:0}} is divided by {{CT:1}}.</p>\n<p>[[input:ans1]]</p>\n<p>[[validation:ans1]]</p>\n<p> </p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>By the remainder theorem when a polynomial \\(f\\left(x\\right)\\) is divided by \\(x - a\\), the remainder is \\(f\\left(a\\right)\\). So if we divide {{CT:0}} by {{CT:1}} the remainder is \\[{{CT:2}} \\cdot {{CT:3}}^2 + {{CT:4}} \\cdot {{CT:3}} + {{CT:5}} = {{CT:2}} \\cdot {{CT:6}} + {{CT:7}} + {{CT:5}} = {{CT:8}}.\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "*", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "f_d", "testoptions": "tol:0", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-FAC-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-FAC-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "a_magnitude", "a_sign", "b", "b_magnitude", "b_sign", "bd", "c", "c_magnitude", "c_sign", "d", "d2", "f_d", "fx", "x_minus_d"], "nvariants": 50}